Description: InfiniteOS management platform (backend + frontend)
 InfiniteOS provides a web-based management plane for compute, containers,
 virtual machines, network, storage, and system observability.
 This package deploys:
  - backend API as a systemd service (iosm-backend)
  - frontend static files served by nginx with /api reverse proxy
